{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_005_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f317a4313c8391be3ec272b19453fb539e31117b2ebbfd6b86b02c7ab13dfd03",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ff3ffe4c7ef9077b96364399ae1067b0fbb896966519879ab6125150ac42f39",
      "text": "……真是让人操心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f4ed4be17f34a310c5a315de408d384cda06ff72302aad751d0b97a91e18369",
      "text": "不好意思。\n因为熬夜让您担心了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db424ffbce7ceeee4f897be9dcc20a013469f7591ff84245708662a7059a7fdf",
      "text": "别以为只是单纯的睡眠不足就掉以轻心。\n从今以后，睡眠也要保证充足。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0295ac12d35af9eb522a4daa646c5e369ea5f88776a464a05ed31c662ebc82f",
      "text": "好的……真惭愧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9806f47f9392bf36bb45c3bfd1723399d9d9af84ad786a0ae91c3038552d7823",
      "text": "把这个拿去用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cebd971907c897f8f621efc2c6831bdaf717ab1ca6eee04f6e679484834bc038",
      "text": "……？毛毯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e92768bd91a6dcdc66bb92a3a2531e7453260a396293509efb86a54632cf542e",
      "text": "去沙发上稍微睡一会儿吧。\n……不管工作完没做完，都去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499",
      "text": "非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:824e3a2f8a846568216faa4cdb45eea911b5f3b65ef243b07903d9279142ee29",
      "text": "（……呜，一躺下来睡意排山倒海地涌上来了……\n听薰先生的话，稍微睡一会儿吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:498275c264a09b8e4119153d8816b19ce54ea95ae859394551b3be7e1c4e5b32",
      "text": "（咦？薰先生要去哪里呢。\n是要回去了吗。嘛，反正事情也办完了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_005kao_01_1_2_005_01:1_2_005_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ee4d1acf9e63e659b139f240133a9717543133bbd3d0d99266071b2429aa686",
      "text": "……呼……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
